                                "sense_id": "0fe77672-1408-3e53-ab0f-d8fbb5564053",
                                "text": "Her songs take us through many mood changes from lighthearted lovesongs and social commentary to a serious searching for answers and understanding."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef3c3bee-7b05-48c8-bc51-a81384d1789f",
                                "sense_id": "0fe77672-1408-3e53-ab0f-d8fbb5564053",
                                "text": "Depending on whom you ask, Antony Flew is either a true convert whose lifelong intellectual searchings finally brought him to God or a senescent scholar possibly being exploited by his associates."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
